      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMPTON BLUE (1) flew the lids with a strong early split and led throughout to score an impressive win by 11 lengths over 305m at this track (17.53). Can measure up again. BOURNE MUNCHKIN (2) hit the frame two back then broke through last time by 0.8 lengths (17.86) at this track over 305m. Boxed well here. Has three placings this course. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. PAPERBOY (5) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.67 beating Bourne Reagan. Has a tricky draw to overcome but has the ability and in winning form. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Should feature again. READY TO BURN (4) won as favourite last time – cannot be taken lightly.",
